config EP_DRIVER_UC81XX_BWRY
    bool "E-Ink UC81xx-class 4-color BWRY (e.g. PicPak 4.2\" 400x300)"
    help
        Driver for UC81xx / SSD2683-class 4-colour BWRY (black/white/red/yellow)
        e-paper panels driven directly over SPI (SCLK/MOSI/CS/DC/RST/BUSY), such
        as the PicPak Tesserae 4.2" 400x300 panel. The panel takes a 2-bit-per-
        pixel framebuffer; the driver repacks the 4bpp GUI_Paint nibble buffer
        before streaming it. Native (MTP) panel waveform, ~1 MHz SPI.
